    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gorgeous action fighting girl Sakura-R is here on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting Girl Sakura-R is a platformer action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate your character and defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">characteristics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brilliant action and upbringing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can use various combos and skills to subdue your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can grow your character through rewards and level ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013060/extras/99fa95a7b22946d623a426f9dbad7f35.poster.avif?t=1753693764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013060/extras/99fa95a7b22946d623a426f9dbad7f35.webm?t=1753693764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013060/extras/99fa95a7b22946d623a426f9dbad7f35.mp4?t=1753693764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> In-game HCG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can enjoy in-game HCG if you get knocked down by enemy attacks while playing. You can also enjoy it in EXTRA gallery mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013060/extras/6696c181b964651fd1c7efedf5645585.poster.avif?t=1753693764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013060/extras/6696c181b964651fd1c7efedf5645585.webm?t=1753693764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013060/extras/6696c181b964651fd1c7efe